      "text": "Lattice QCD calculation of the Compton amplitude subtraction function — 16 sections: Front matter; Lattice QCD calculation of the Com; Introduction\n\n**Lattice QCD calculation of the Compton amplitude subtraction function**\n\n*T. Schar,1 G. Schierholz,4 H. Stüben,5 R. D. Young,1 and J. M. Zanotti1*\n\n15 pp, 16 sections.\n\n**Outline.** Front matter; Lattice QCD calculation of the Compton amplitu; Introduction; Background; Feynman-Hellmann method; Lattice determination; Subtraction Function Results; Discretisation artefacts; Free fermion; Proton subtraction function; Evaluation of the discretisation artefact; Improved subtraction function; Summary and Conclusions; Acknowledgements; Details of Lattice Operator Product Expansion; Tabulated Subtraction Function Results",
